@DailyTrackerService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5226

### Weatherforecast (sample minimal-API endpoint)
GET {{DailyTrackerService_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Get all daily items
GET {{DailyTrackerService_HostAddress}}/api/dailyitems
Accept: application/json

### Get one daily item
GET {{DailyTrackerService_HostAddress}}/api/dailyitems/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a daily item
POST {{DailyTrackerService_HostAddress}}/api/dailyitems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Workout",
  "notes": "30 min run",
  "isCompleted": false,
  "date": "2026-05-20"
}

### Replace a daily item (PUT)
PUT {{DailyTrackerService_HostAddress}}/api/dailyitems/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Read 50 pages",
  "notes": null,
  "isCompleted": true,
  "date": "2026-05-22"
}

### Partial update a daily item (PATCH)
PATCH {{DailyTrackerService_HostAddress}}/api/dailyitems/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}

### Get a non-existing item (expect 404)
GET {{DailyTrackerService_HostAddress}}/api/dailyitems/999
Accept: application/json
